meta {
  name: Accounts
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/accounts
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  Ordered by institution, then the resolved display name - never raw_name
  directly, so a renamed account sorts where it's displayed. When ugc_name is
  blank (null or whitespace-only), name falls back to "institution rawName
  ••mask" (e.g. "Chase Ultimate Rewards® ••7614"; mask omitted when there
  isn't one) rather than the bank's often-generic raw_name alone. Excludes
  ugc_is_hidden accounts by default. Each row carries both name (resolved)
  and rawName (the bank's), so a settings UI can show "renamed from …" and
  offer a reset without a second call.
}
